    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n81797" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιολισθ-άνω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>slip about.</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Art.</u>
				47
			</span></i>; <i>slip away all round</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>VM</u>
				22
			</span></i>. cf. <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				14.10
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ναῦς π</span>. <i>slips
			off</i> the engine, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Marc.</u>
				15
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ βέλη π. ἀπὸ [τῶν βυρσῶν]</span>
			<i>glance off</i> them, <i><span class="en">
