				<u>BJ</u>
				3.7.10
			</span></i>: metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡδονὴ π. εἰς τὸ
			σῶμα</span> (v.l. for
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δι</span>-) <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.1089d
			</span></i> : later <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιολισθ-ολισθαίνω</span></b> , metaph., <i>wander, stray from
				the point</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plot.
				2.2.1
			</span></i>.</div>
